 "{#}{#}\n \nBreak the locks placed on the Nexus\nand cleanse the creeping darkness.\nOnce the connections have been restored,\nthe path to Orphion will be revealed": "",
 "{#}{#}\nCrystalline Decays will spawn on {~} clouds.\nKill them all within the time limit.\n\n{#} There is less time to{#}\nkill the Crystalline Decays.": "",
 "{#}{#}\nDefend the Blue Bulb from\nenemy Bulb Catchers.\n\n{#} There is less time to kill{#}\nBulb Catchers that caught the Bulb.": "",
 "{#}{#}\nOne player must pick up\nand wield the Artifact.\n\nThe Wielder and the Rest of\nthe Party must work together\nto destroy the Anchors of Hate.": "",
 "{#}{#}\nOne player must pick up and\nwield the Sonic Amplifier.\n\nThe Rest of the Party must\nthen defeat an onslaught\nof guards to progress.": "",
 "{#}{#}\nParasites will attack the crystals.\nKill them or the tower will decay!\n\n{#} Parasites spawn more often{#}\nand there is less time to kill them.": "",
 "{#}{#}\nSigils will spawn, summoning\ndevils that will attack\nthe soldiers directly!\n\n{#} The sigils deal damage around{#}\nthemselves when summoning devils!": "",
 "{#}{#}\nThe Rest of the Party must break the\nHardened Crusts to expose the Anchors.\n\nOnce an Anchor is exposed, someone must\nremain nearby and hold it to prevent\nit from burying itself once more.\n\n{#} Anchors bury themselves faster and{#}\ncannot be destroyed while held by\nsomeone else, so players must let\ngo of them at the right time.": "",
 "{#}{#}\nThe Wielder must use the Artifact\nto charge through and destroy Anchors\nand Obstacles indicated by white rings.\n\nThe Artifact will summon a Creature\nafter every use that must be defeated\nbefore the Artifact can be used again.": "",
 "{#}{#}\nThe Wielder must use the Sonic Amplifier\nto break holes in the ceiling's weakpoints,\nindicated by cracks in the glass.\n\n{#} Breaking weakpoints additionally requires{#}\nusing the correct shown input button.\n\nWith enough weakpoints broken, the\nWielder can call down a blast of light\nthat will break any enemy shields.\n\n{#} This blast is narrower and also{#}\nunleashes a shockwave that can\nhurt the Rest of the Party.": "",
 "{#}{#}\nThe guards possess powerful shields\nwhich render direct attacks ineffective\nuntil the shield is broken.\n\nPeriodically, a Gendarme Caster will\nappear in the arena.\n\nUpon death, all shielded guards\nwill be pulled towards its position.": "",
 "{#}{#}\nTo close the Giant Rift, you must close the \nLesser Rifts that are appearing\naround the room by completing challenges.\nClose {~} Lesser Rifts to collapse the Giant Rift.\n\n{#} Several rifts are more difficult.{#}": "",
 "{#}{#}\nUse water on overflowing lava flows before it's too late!\nThey will speed up as the challenge goes on.\n\n{#} The lava flows will overflow faster.{#}\n\nYou gain a greater time bonus\nthe faster you cool the lava flow.": "",
